  "notes": "The issue built the slimmer whole itinerary read that #129 settled on. It went from 775 to 1,027 words in 3 versions within about 30 minutes, all before PR #153 opened, and nothing was added after. It is almost all task (83% of its words). The Do items are long and exact: they name functions and files, and spell out the format details the design doc left open (I151-7, I151-8, I151-13). It has no open questions (I151-6) and no struck text. The PR description copies the Do and Done when word for word (P153-d0 to d13) and adds only results (P153-d14 to d19), so it adds nothing to the task. The decisions comment holds 8 implementation choices the issue didn't spell out, such as naming the new detail level \"slim\" (P153-c1) and where a test file goes (P153-c7). Only one of the 8 says it was written into a design doc (P153-c2, domain model 3.10). Results went only into the PR description."
